# Default (no .env): mock.shop demo data — full local dev, no credentials.
# To link the test store, copy this to .env and fill in (all values come from the
# Hydrogen sales channel's env dump after Robert connects it — see docs/OWNER-CHECKLIST.md):
# SESSION_SECRET=any-long-random-string
# PUBLIC_STORE_DOMAIN=<store>.myshopify.com
# PUBLIC_STOREFRONT_API_TOKEN=<from Hydrogen channel>
# PUBLIC_CHECKOUT_DOMAIN=<from Hydrogen channel — feeds the CSP (entry.server.tsx) and consent/analytics config (root.tsx)>
# PUBLIC_STOREFRONT_ID=<from Hydrogen channel — used for analytics>
#
# Account login (app/routes/account*) additionally needs the Customer Account API vars from
# the same Hydrogen-channel env dump:
# SHOP_ID=
# PUBLIC_CUSTOMER_ACCOUNT_API_CLIENT_ID=
# PRIVATE_STOREFRONT_API_TOKEN=
